  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Greater Comilla Infrastructure Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at construction of 200 km feeder roads including 1,200 m bridges and culverts and 12 growth centres, improvement of existing rural access roads, improvement of physical facilities of the growth centres in order to enhance their economic and commercial importance, development of an effective communication network by improving partially developed important rural roads.</narrative>
  </description>
